></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Legendary_Gem_of_Many_Facets.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Legendary_Gem_of_Many_Facets.png/420px-Legendary_Gem_of_Many_Facets.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"612\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Legendary_Gem_of_Many_Facets.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>From this chain hangs a gem that is very finely cut, giving it countless glittering faces. It can take the place of various other items for the purpose of activating certain set bonuses.</i>\n<p>This item will randomly choose from available set bonuses whenever it is re-acquired or upgraded to a higher level version. This item is also keyed for Essence Crafting, and may be Disjuncted so that it can be crafted upon. Note that upgrading this item to a higher level version through Epic or Legendary Crafting will destroy what has been crafted upon it, and will also re-roll available set bonuses.<i></i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>You can reroll the set bonuses for 100 <a href=\"/page/Item:Thread_of_Fate\" title=\"Item:Thread of Fate\">Threads of Fate</a> at the <a href=\"/page/Altar_of_Legendary_Rituals\" title=\"Altar of Legendary Rituals\">Altar of Legendary Rituals</a>.</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260816160422\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.141 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.204 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 12216/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 103015/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 59105/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4051/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  169.665      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  169.665      1 -total\n 98.34%  166.841      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 84.16%  142.787    139 Template:IO\n 28.06%   47.610     28 Template:Popup\n 25.71%   43.622      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 25.07%   42.527      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 24.50%   41.564      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 23.94%   40.621      2 Template:InCategory\n 21.70%   36.809      2 Template:Collapsed_effect\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:91995-0!canonical and timestamp 20260816160422 and revision id 684172. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"
